Below is a complete, runnable Flask app that renders a compact /embed UI for pasting recipe text or uploading .txt/.pdf files. It validates inputs server-side (type and size), extracts ingredients, performs public lookups (Wikipedia/Wikidata/Datamuse) with timeouts and error handling, generates a whimsical “spell,” and displays clear success/error pages. It is self-contained with the /embed GET form and POST handlers required.

